  "description": "Innovative financial toolkit for .NET - IBAN validation, payment references, VAT validation, PEPPOL, UBL generation, and SEPA. Comprehensive library for European and international financial operations including banking, tax, and e-invoicing capabilities. Supports Belgian OGM/VCS, ISO 11649 (RF) international references, with roadmap for multi-country IBAN, VAT, SEPA, and e-invoicing standards.",
